\item \strong{positive predictive value} (\code{PPV}):
\deqn{PPV_R = P(D = 1 \mid R \textrm{ positive}) = \frac{\pi\, Se_R}{\pi\, Se_R + (1 - \pi)(1 - Sp_R)},}
